            --font-title: 'Orbitron', sans-serif;
            --font-main: 'Rajdhani', sans-serif;
            --radius-base: 4px;
            --shadow-glow: 0 0 15px var(--accent-cyan-glow);
            --shadow-text: 0 0 8px var(--accent-cyan-glow);
        }

        body {
            background-color: transparent;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 10px;
            font-family: var(--font-main);
            color: var(--text-light-main);
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .main-interface {
            width: 100%;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: var(--bg-dark-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
            padding: 20px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }
        .main-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            text-shadow: var(--shadow-text);
        }
        .main-header h2 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin: 0;
            color: var(--accent-cyan-main);
            font-family: var(--font-title);
        }
        .header-info {
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-medium-dim);
        }
        .story-content-wrapper {
            padding: 20px;
            background: var(--bg-medium-glass);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: var(--radius-base);
        }
        .story-content p {
            margin-bottom: 1.5em;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--text-light-main);
            text-indent: 2em;
            letter-spacing: 0.05em;
            white-space: pre-wrap;
        }
        .player-choices {
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-color);
        }
        .choice-header {
            font-family: var(--font-title);
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: var(--accent-cyan-main);
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-shadow: var(--shadow-text);
        }
        .form-input {
            width: 100%;
            background-color: var(--bg-light-element);
            color: var(--text-light-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: var(--radius-base);
            padding: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .form-input::placeholder {
            color: var(--text-medium-dim);
        }
        .choice-option {
            background-color: var(--bg-light-element);
            color: var(--text-light-main);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: var(--radius-base);
            padding: 15px 20px;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .choice-option:hover {
            background-color: var(--accent-cyan-main);
            color: var(--bg-dark-main);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-glow);
        }
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            body { padding: 5px; }
            .main-interface { padding: 10px; }
            .main-header h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="main-interface">
        <div class="main-header">
            <h2 id="main-title">主神空间</h2>
            <div class="header-info"><span id="main-time">正在扫描...</span></div>
        </div>

        <div class="story-content-wrapper">
            <div class="story-content">
                <p>你正坐在电脑前，浏览着网页，忽然，一个弹窗出现在屏幕中央。</p>
                <p>“你想知道生命的真正意义吗？你想……真正地活着吗？”</p>
                <p>你鬼使神差地点下了“是”，瞬间，你被一道白光吞噬。当你再次睁开眼睛时，你发现自己漂浮在一片虚无的黑暗之中。</p>
                <p>一个冰冷的声音在你的脑海中响起：“欢迎来到主神空间，现在，告诉我你是谁。”</p>
            </div>
            <div class="player-choices">
                <div class="choice-header">输入你的信息</div>
                <form id="character-form">
                    <input type="text" id="name" class="form-input" placeholder="姓名" required>
                    <input type="text" id="gender" class="form-input" placeholder="性别" required>
                    <input type="number" id="age" class="form-input" placeholder="年龄" required>
                    <textarea id="background" class="form-input" placeholder="简单叙述背景" rows="4" required></textarea>
                    <button type="submit" class="choice-option">提交</button>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        document.getElementById('character-form').addEventListener('submit', function(event) {
            event.preventDefault();

            const name = document.getElementById('name').value;
            const gender = document.getElementById('gender').value;
            const age = document.getElementById('age').value;
            const background = document.getElementById('background').value;

            const message = `(${name}，${gender}，${age}，${background})`;

            if (parent.document.getElementById('send_textarea')) {
                const textarea = parent.document.getElementById('send_textarea');
                const sendButton = parent.document.getElementById('send_but');

                if (textarea && sendButton) {
                    textarea.value = message;
                    sendButton.click();
                } else {
                    alert("无法找到输入框或发送按钮。");
                }
            } else {
                alert("无法连接到酒馆。请在酒馆扩展中打开此页面。");
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>

